<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-WEST INDIES 77 FOR TWO AT CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-WEST INDIES 77 FOR TWO AT CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-12-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia, leading after their first innings by 27 runs, were 77 for two in their second innings at close of play on the third day of the second test at the Sydney Cricket Ground on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scores - Australia 331 (Greg Blewett 69) and 77 for two; West Indies 304 (Sherwin Campbell 77).</p>
